            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Draftava 1.3.3

- Fixes live iCloud workspace reloads unexpectedly switching this Mac to a different draft.
- Prevents Draftava from freezing during launch or activation when retained History contains cloud-only iCloud files.
- Keeps existing iCloud conflict protection intact while avoiding forced downloads during asset cleanup.
